**Verdict:** PASS.

## 7. Scope limitation

This remains a path normal form, not a C-II contradiction.  In particular:

- `28559` bounds support size, not KKT multiplier size;
- the one/two reaction bars need not have macroscopic multiplier weight;
- no strict diameter-decreasing finite move is obtained;
